<title>GERMANY: VW share breaks 1,000 marks level in IBIS.</title>
<headline>VW share breaks 1,000 marks level in IBIS.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German carmaker Volkswagen AG passed the 1,000 mark threshold for the first time in IBIS DAX electronic trade, an important psychological level for the equity.</p>
<p>By 1127 GMT Volkswagen shares had come off the 1,000 mark level to stand at 996 marks in IBIS, up 43.95 marks or 4.62 percent and making it the biggest gainer in electronic trade.</p>
<p>The overall IBIS DAX index was down 15.94 points or 0.48 percent at 3,348.55 points.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
